# Checkouts materialize LF on every platform. The generators and gates in this
# repository emit and compare LF, and the test loader cannot parse a module
# whose shebang line ends in CRLF: under a core.autocrlf checkout, every test
# that imports a script from scripts/ fails to collect with a bare SyntaxError.
# The eol attribute overrides core.autocrlf, so a clean clone behaves the same
# with or without that global setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
